{"id":"vod_lz_72936","vodId":"72936","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"青之驱魔师","name_cn":"青之驱魔师","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20231006-1/11149f24e72dbc69b9d2840fe307f6cf.jpg"},"summary":"奥村磷（冈本信彦 配音）自幼被神父藤本狮郎（藤原启治 配音）收养，某一日，磷发现了自己其实是撒旦之子的秘密，之后养父的惨死让磷下定居心走上了驱魔师的道路。磷所存在的世界被分为“物质界”和“虚无界”两大空间，人类生存于物质界，在虚无界中，则徘徊着凶残暴戾的魔鬼。　　身边接连发生的伤害事件让磷逐渐发现，某些虚无界的恶魔，趁虚而入潜入了人类世界。为了伸张正义保护同类，磷果断的担负起了驱魔的职责。在弟弟奥村雪男（福山润 配音）的帮助下，磷不断的向着真相前进，此时的磷也发现，造成这一切混乱的元凶，可能就藏在他们的身边。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-06 20:16:09","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v.cdnlz17.com/20231005/27992_d9ea088a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v.cdnlz17.com/20231005/27994_28bc842f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v.cdnlz17.com/20231005/27996_8314aa3e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v.cdnlz17.com/20231005/27998_1b764afa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v.cdnlz17.com/20231005/27997_7c6d3d5d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v.cdnlz17.com/20231005/27999_1c1ea293/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v.cdnlz17.com/20231005/28002_cdcc0db1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v.cdnlz17.com/20231005/28001_c2be7c25/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v.cdnlz17.com/20231005/28000_0055b359/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v.cdnlz17.com/20231005/28003_acdec7b0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v.cdnlz17.com/20231005/28004_88059d2e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v.cdnlz17.com/20231005/28008_7e0aed4e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v.cdnlz17.com/20231005/28007_735dc40b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v.cdnlz17.com/20231005/28010_269970e6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v.cdnlz17.com/20231005/28005_2dd7ce6f/index.m3u8"},{